# AI Provider API Keys for ResumeForge
# The application automatically runs with any subset of these configured, using a fallback chain: Gemini -> Groq -> OpenRouter.

# 1. Google Gemini API Key: https://aistudio.google.com/
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# 2. Groq Cloud API Key: https://console.groq.com/
GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here

# 3. OpenRouter API Key: https://openrouter.ai/
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_openrouter_api_key_here
